---
import Eyebrow from '~/components/ui/Eyebrow.astro';
import PricingCard from '~/components/ui/PricingCard.astro';
---

<section id="pricing" class="paper grain section-y overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
  <div class="container-content">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end" data-reveal>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <Eyebrow index="03">Own it</Eyebrow>
        <h2 id="pricing-title" class="mt-7 text-display font-medium tracking-display text-fg">
          Pay once.<br />Keep every update.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-md text-lead text-fg-secondary lg:col-span-5 lg:pb-3">
        Your tools shouldn’t stop working when a payment lapses. One licence for the software, every future version, no tiers and no upgrade fees.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-14 lg:mt-20" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:100ms">
      <PricingCard />
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 border-t border-line pt-8 md:grid-cols-12">
        <p class="text-sm text-fg-secondary md:col-span-8">
          <strong class="font-medium text-fg">Software you own.</strong> Your licence covers the SixLine desktop app and every
          update to it. If optional hosted services are ever offered, they’ll be separate and priced on their own — never needed
          to keep using the software you own.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm md:col-span-4 md:text-right">
          <a href="/pricing" class="link-quiet text-fg-secondary">How the licence and free trial work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
